  "description": "Cha Yu-Hwan, a man in his mid-thirties, was just getting by day by day, having given up on his dreams. At the temp agency he turned to for work, he greets the dawn alongside strangers. Caught between the harsh realities of the job site and his own inexperience, Yu-Hwan gradually learns how to live again.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
